@startuml E46a-suspect-queue
!include ../includes/C4_Sequence_Macros.puml

title E46a — Suspect queue review\ncarry-forward | keep-pinned | drop (ARCH-SUSPECT-QUEUE)

C4Seq_User()
C4Seq_WebUI()
C4Seq_RouteGuard()
C4Seq_API()
C4Seq_RBAC()
C4Seq_Business()
C4Seq_Data()
C4Seq_Postgres()
C4Seq_Audit()
C4Seq_OTEL()

note over seqUser, seqOTEL
  After **content** mint (D39d), inbound edges / in_scope_of /
  delivers that still pin prior UIDs are trace_suspect
  (ARCH-SUSPECT). Queue reactions are audited.
  Role defaults: Satisfies/refines/uses → Author;
  ConformsTo → Security; contract/release → Author + RelMgr.
end note

== Open queue ==

seqUser -> seqWebUI : Open suspect queue / filter
RbacRouteGuard("trace:suspect:queue")
ClientScopedQuery("GET", "/clients/{clientId}/suspects")
ControlNote(seqAPI, "AC-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "List open trace_suspect edges and junctions")

seqAPI -> seqBusiness : listSuspects(actor, clientId)
RbacCheck("trace:suspect:queue")
seqBusiness -> seqData : query trace_suspect=true
seqData -> seqPostgres : SELECT edges / junctions WHERE trace_suspect
seqPostgres --> seqData : rows
seqData --> seqBusiness : suspects
seqBusiness --> seqAPI : DTO
seqAPI --> seqWebUI : queue
seqWebUI --> seqUser : review items

== React (carry-forward | keep-pinned | drop) ==

seqUser -> seqWebUI : Choose reaction on item
ClientScopedQuery("POST", "/clients/{clientId}/suspects/{id}:react")
seqAPI -> seqBusiness : reactSuspect(actor, id, action)
ControlNote(seqBusiness, "AC-3, CM-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "ARCH-SUSPECT-QUEUE reactions")

RbacCheck("trace:suspect:carry|keep_pinned|drop")
ControlNote(seqRBAC, "AC-3, AC-6", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Reaction RBAC by edge/junction kind")

HookEval("trace:suspect:react")
note right of seqBusiness
  Profile may bind empty gates_before;
  optional gate-no-open-suspect on **G61** ship
  denies while queue remains open.
end note

alt carry-forward
  seqBusiness -> seqData : retarget edge/junction to new tip;\nclear trace_suspect
else keep-pinned
  seqBusiness -> seqData : acknowledge stale pin;\nclear suspect flag without retarget
else drop
  seqBusiness -> seqData : remove edge/junction
end
seqData -> seqPostgres : UPDATE/DELETE …
ControlNote(seqPostgres, "AC-3, CM-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "SoT update for suspect resolution")
seqPostgres --> seqData : ok
seqData --> seqBusiness : result

HookEffectsAfter("audit")
AuditLog("trace.suspect.react", "id action")
ControlNote(seqAudit, "AU-2, AU-3, AU-12", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Every suspect reaction audited")

seqBusiness --> seqAPI : DTO
seqAPI --> seqWebUI : 200 OK
seqWebUI --> seqUser : queue updated

@enduml
